    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「熊ちゃんってば、まだ帰ってなかったの？　つうかマジでやってるんだ『七夕セブン』……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「ごめんね、その変なコスチューム押しつけちゃって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「うちの委員長が、そういう『正義の味方』っぽいの好きでさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「いらないって言ってるのにプレゼントされて、持て余しちゃってたからさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「熊ちゃんが有効活用してくれて、助かっちゃったよ♪」"
  },
  {
